## Use roles before values

Choose a role, then resolve it through the shared theme tokens. For example, use the focus token on a custom button rather than copying a yellow hex value because it looks close.

The canonical palette data is `design-system/palettes.json` in the repository. Generated theme data and YAML must be reproducible from that source. Documentation must not become a competing source of colour truth.

## Know who owns what

- The [colour](brand-colour.html), [typography](brand-typography.html), [data](brand-data.html) and [illustration](illustration.html) pages are ordinary interface guidance. They are not a second brand system inside a home.
- For a family name, crest or business logo, follow [Personalise your home](../get-started/personalisation.html).
- The civica [project identity](brand.html) belongs to this documentation and to promotion of the project.
- The [work-package checklist](../community/guidance-work-package.html) records source coverage and review loops. The [design-system audit](../community/design-system-audit.html) lists the changes still needed.

